{"time": 1770200227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713507355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她似乎正在和绿毛(神山露)聊天。"}
{"time": 1770200276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702632871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "神山露你也知道，是剑道社的成员，不过也是她极力主张不存在的人这一条件，促成了你被孤立的事实。"}
