{"time": 1770201561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305973601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "横须贺，班里老师的跑腿，此刻和你面面相觑，手脚无处安放，表情满是惊恐"}
{"time": 1770201598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671142897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "一如寻常，不存在一般，拍拍身上的灰，直接离开"}
