{"time": 1770707397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610623564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随着下课铃响起，学生陆续前往社团活动"}
{"time": 1770707428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260159326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我有社团吗）"}
{"time": 1770707438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533802938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（或者说我可以在设定上有吗）"}
{"time": 1770707531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174740549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以)"}
{"time": 1770707548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567402017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那边正常吗 还是说依旧不存在）"}
{"time": 1770707786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675726414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大概不会有什么人理你)"}
{"time": 1770707835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579994458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那没必要去了）"}
{"time": 1770707940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110359190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "在课室再待一会，看会书，等课室的人走完。思索纸条可能从哪个方向扔过来的"}
{"time": 1770708466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870060473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "课室里的人当然没那么快走完，除开陆续离开的社团活动的学生，归家部们三三两两聚在一起，商议着下午的行程"}
{"time": 1770708481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298133295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1110359190]可以灵感"}
{"time": 1770708485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29552675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "。ra灵感"}
{"time": 1770708485, "type": "reply", "message_id": "29552675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[星野鶇]进行技能[灵感:60]检定: 1D100=92/60 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1770708490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840687242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（没成功过）"}
{"time": 1770708551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966816323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "反正也没啥事情做，争取今天看完明天还书去。顺便看看华工七大不可思议有没有蜜汁纸条和蜜汁成像"}
{"time": 1770708782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082395560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐在教室最后一排，前面任何地方都有扔东西到后面的可能?你这么想着，继续看书。教室里的人流逐渐走空"}
{"time": 1770708911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169384352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "范围还是太大了，灵异事件找不到实时支撑，就只能靠猜了，虽然我也没对此抱太大希望。"}
{"time": 1770708938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274159713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "往将台走，顺便看看各个位置的物品。然后拿起粉笔，在黑板写几个字，“在吗”"}
{"time": 1770708952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502564171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=274159713]（往讲台走）"}
{"time": 1770709078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419997077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "教室里最后几个人看了看你的动作，紧皱着眉跑出来教室。"}
{"time": 1770709173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627580176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "就这么过了半晌，你听到了啪嗒一声的轻响，从旁边的窗户传来，在你抬头的时候，你看见一个纸条顺着吹进的风和扬起的窗帘落到你的脚边。"}
{"time": 1770709318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133265516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "擦掉黑板的粉笔字，捡起来看看"}
{"time": 1770709502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373158676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“能被你找到很好啦~”字迹依然俏皮，“可以帮帮我吗？让更多人找到我~”"}
{"time": 1770709534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383368274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你是谁，怎么帮你，你在哪”拿起粉笔写下几个字"}
{"time": 1770709931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852307435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "灵感一下"}
{"time": 1770712810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449999154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（人呢）"}
{"time": 1770714720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198511424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "。ra灵感"}
{"time": 1770714720, "type": "reply", "message_id": "198511424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[星野鶇]进行技能[灵感:60]检定: 1D100=58/60 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1770714728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59650564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（终于成功一次）"}
{"time": 1770714919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767042241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "风声再起，却被突然的推门声打断"}
{"time": 1770714949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972057212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看见神山露从门外走进教室，看了你一眼，去了教室后面取她的木剑。"}
{"time": 1770714969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973123837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "把黑板的字擦掉吧，希望她没见到"}
{"time": 1770715003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485354991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "翻书找找不可思议有没有类似的事件，等她出去"}
{"time": 1770729163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277011200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1770729257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703370772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（有人卡着你）"}
{"time": 1770729261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206453721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（刚刚骂过了）"}
{"time": 1770729306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847070204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她没有管你，或者单纯是当做没看见，拿起自己的东西就离开了"}
{"time": 1770729334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86173856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（彳亍）"}
{"time": 1770729359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874165868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "‘还在吗’，看她走了，再写上去"}
{"time": 1770729795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26385821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "长久地没有回应，直到突然有一瞬间，你的耳边响起了一道温柔的女声，眼前被人盖住，剥夺了视野，不过却能感到对方的体温和淡淡的体香，“我在~”"}
{"time": 1770729872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418532731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“谁！”内心一个激灵，身体本能地往另一边缩了一下，看向声音来源的方向"}
{"time": 1770730058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771894647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对方似乎很迁就你，跟着你调整了一下位置，至少还是遮住了你的眼睛，“不用害怕嘛~毕竟鸫找到了我？不是一直想，一直想，和我交谈吗？”语气轻柔"}
{"time": 1770730231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849127314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不好意思....”手伸撇开刘海，整理一下头发。“毕竟这种出场太特别了。”"}
{"time": 1770730257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098561913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "叹口气，声音轻下来，“毕竟我也，没有朋友嘛”"}
{"time": 1770730452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819402522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不是没有吧？”她的语气带着调侃，“还是习惯了？”"}
{"time": 1770730565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051954521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“习惯啦，也不可能交到啦。看来你不清楚这里的事情哦？”释怀地说着，把手搭在掩着我眼睛的手上"}
{"time": 1770730599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133229557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "回忆一下这个声音我有没有听到过"}
{"time": 1770730702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171279507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这只手给人的触感称得上吹弹可破，就像她的声音一样，陌生，但有有些熟悉，你说不好这种感觉，她再度开口，“这里的事情？”"}
{"time": 1770730744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136104078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯”点点头，轻轻拉开她的手"}
{"time": 1770730786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202092292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不行哦？”她的手微微用力，继续挡住你的视线，“女生要神秘一点，才有人爱呢。”"}
{"time": 1770730845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418608554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "无奈地笑笑，“你是学校的学生吗，还是谁”"}
{"time": 1770730871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581925848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“我可不太建议你和我搭话呢”"}
{"time": 1770730969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506655098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我？是学生哦？”她的语气咯咯笑，“为什么不建议和你说话？明明是你想和我说呢。”"}
{"time": 1770731107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027952065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "摇摇头，“我猜一下，你是新来的转校生吗？具体的事情问问班里的人就好。现在的事情建议你不要和他们说。谢谢你和我说话，我先走了。”抬起脚步，往门口走去"}
{"time": 1770731210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519817730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“真是的，死脑筋。”她拉住你，“要走也是我先走啦，乖乖闭着眼睛哦？”"}
{"time": 1770731323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260557908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“是嘛，相关资料太少，也是为了大家的安全而已......”停下脚步，闭上眼睛"}
{"time": 1770731424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679917902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你感觉软飘飘的东西被放进手心，随后听到哒哒的脚步离开声"}
{"time": 1770731493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820396342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "等她离开，睁开眼睛看看手上的东西"}
{"time": 1770731511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96987762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“对不起...”"}
