{"time": 1770802288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415400142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你并不认识，不过对方腿上刚刚擦出了大块擦伤"}
{"time": 1770802612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982429717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看见班长上前扶起他，随后两人似乎争执了起来"}
{"time": 1770802796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484572608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "也许是教室中那个场景的触动，看到他的伤势，不自觉迈开步子想要帮忙。不过一想，自己并不需要这样，就那么停下脚步，看着他们的争执，观察两边的神情，听听他们争论什么"}
{"time": 1770803483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318426918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "可以侦查一下"}
