{"time": 1770807669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359635279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "想到书包里的怪谈读物，去墓地看看吧，顺便买点花和甜品给车祸死去的妹妹上坟"}
{"time": 1770808523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864206119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一切都没什么生气，在这暮色之下，你走进了墓园，一排排墓碑冷冽地立在秋风中，有些无人打理已经开裂，你在其中找到了你妹妹的墓碑"}
{"time": 1770808549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482477501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "‘藤冈未咲’"}
{"time": 1770808610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2053833525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（byd怎么不同姓）"}
{"time": 1770808733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692555463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "用手撇开灰尘，把点心放在上面。花瓣放在坟前，轻轻摸下坟头。稍后，后退两步，鞠躬，离开去看看传闻中的无碑孤坟。"}
{"time": 1770808778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76900736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1770808785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21884598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这是原著那个妹妹啊)"}
{"time": 1770808800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873638285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我知道啊，但是我不是原著的名字（）"}
{"time": 1770808804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411303870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1770808816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835594510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就星野未咲吧)"}
{"time": 1770808836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282094592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（ok）"}
{"time": 1770809981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108816840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=692555463]当然不止一座，这里未得修缮的孤坟比比皆是，荒凉感顿时弥漫你的心头。"}
{"time": 1770810295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961059871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "悲凄的氛围和市区格格不入，似乎并不属于这座城市，不知为何产生了一丝共情。蹲下摸了摸旁边的杂草，在时光中相比看尽桑田。在这也够久了，也该回家了。"}
{"time": 1770810854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038883363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "离开的时候，你的余光下意识一瞥，似乎看见未咲的墓碑上有白色的裙子飘过。"}
{"time": 1770810878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84416797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“？！”猛地转头"}
{"time": 1770811165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614924573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一笼白纱盖在墓碑之上，如同给死者盖上的白布。你心里不知为何有些悲伤"}
{"time": 1770811463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634524142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“刚刚是有谁在吗？”嘴里呢喃着，走近轻抚着这白纱，感受在手中摩擦的触感"}
{"time": 1770811598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695010956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "质地轻柔，但和葬礼时用到的白布质感很接近"}
{"time": 1770811628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585221165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "白纱有什么异常吗"}
{"time": 1770811690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985004950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "并没有，就好像本来就在那里一样，不过值得注意的是，你放在墓碑前的甜点，奶油已经僵住了"}
{"time": 1770811734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231925329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我觉得理论上会被吓走）"}
{"time": 1770811739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589033645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（但是我意志80）"}
{"time": 1770811763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982360749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（僵住是因为过太久了吗）"}
{"time": 1770811815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372395234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一般过很久才会这样)"}
{"time": 1770811818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035232372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也就是烂掉了)"}
{"time": 1770812096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249613254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "奶油的异样潜意识有些恐惧，虽然是在亲人旁边，但还是先回去好"}
{"time": 1770812278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146006935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回去的路倒是没什么意外，天色暗了下来，这个时候的镇子总有些说不出的诡异感。但至少，你成功到家了。"}
{"time": 1770812428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568902208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "奇怪的纸条，无像的光，墓地的白裙，这让我开始怀疑放课的少女是不是活着的人了。拿起兜里的纸巾看看，“ゆき....”。"}
{"time": 1770812464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111772476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "甩甩头，先放下思虑，开门脱鞋放好，往家里喊，“我回来啦”"}
{"time": 1770812613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602157342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有活人吗家里)"}
