{"time": 1771900270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166953194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "会吗？还是说，一直都要遵守，在校外可以不遵守?矛盾的念头充斥在你的脑海里。"}
{"time": 1771900420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705683628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想不清楚，jpg"}
{"time": 1771900476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806116587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "不过，在她亲人面前打个召唤，看看她反应也很有趣不是吗"}
{"time": 1771900491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347491170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗨，露酱”走去她面前招招手"}
{"time": 1771900671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29493038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她低着头，听到你的话才抬起头"}
{"time": 1771900772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763940130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "站她面前对着她笑呢"}
{"time": 1771900872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985706642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看见她迷茫的眨眨眼睛，然后继续低下头。嘴里小声嘀咕着“怎么还有幻听”"}
{"time": 1771900932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151241584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一旁的妇人眨了眨眼，小声对神山说话，\"小露，同学不是打招呼吗？\""}
{"time": 1771900947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692801479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "对着她旁边那位，“姐姐，露酱是不是身体不舒服呀”"}
{"time": 1771901358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671170896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看见神山露拽了拽妇人的衣袖“好难受...我们.先走吧...”脸色不免难看，女人稍微有些疑惑，对你开口，\"你是小露的同学吧，小露今天身体不舒服，待会也麻烦同学你说一下了。\""}
{"time": 1771901418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157413495", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，露酱好好休息。姐姐我们先走啦”挥挥手笑笑，转身离开去咖啡厅"}
{"time": 1771901444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261134356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，露酱好好休息。姐姐我先走啦”挥挥手笑笑，转身离开去咖啡厅"}
{"time": 1771902646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822282824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "咖啡厅倒是刚刚开了门，里面的陈设很接近(五山机械学院)楼下的那家。"}
