{"time": 1772279035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227647333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（在）"}
{"time": 1772279042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684988384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你说我动）"}
{"time": 1772279137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631195791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "老实说，咖啡厅算得上神弃川前卫的建筑了，不管是花砖还是时兴的彩印玻璃，乃至学生间传阅的漫画或是小说，在这里的书架上都有收录。门口挂着open的牌子，特意修剪的蔓藤下垂在门扉上，整体显得明亮又有朝气。里面的陈设干干净净，不过现在没有人。"}
{"time": 1772279180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466059303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（前台呢）"}
{"time": 1772279221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419862945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(当然也不在)"}
{"time": 1772279362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56081227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "左手摸摸垂下的藤蔓，推开门，随着门上叮当的响声随一句hallo，在咖啡店四处看看有没有诸如纸片之类的小线索，没有就最后落目到书架前，看看书架的书籍"}
{"time": 1772279446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682265480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我有些不记得那个年代看的书了)"}
{"time": 1772279507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498189839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（随便说两句不给书名呗）"}
{"time": 1772279514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806481740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总之，桌面上摆放着水仙或者百合之类的装饰花，书架上陈列着诸如灌篮高手，魔卡少女，水果篮子这样的漫画，当然也有时兴的小说。不过据你看来，大部分小说都没有翻阅的迹象"}
{"time": 1772279721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249214287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "都是一些很普通的书籍，随手拿出来翻两下就放回去了。在靠窗的椅子旁坐下像昨晚那样，撕个小纸条，写上“我来了”，揉皱丢到桌子对面的座位上，然后掏出家里带过来的小镜子，借着阳光往对面座位晃一晃"}
{"time": 1772279796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625239920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么形状的镜子)"}
{"time": 1772279843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175768389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（圆形，那种女生可以随身携带的小镜子）"}
{"time": 1772279861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709835775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1772279899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452185413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "显然镜子里不会照出什么特殊的东西，不过在这会，店长从里间探出了脑袋，\"咦，这么早就有同学来了吗？\""}
{"time": 1772279942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589502120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "店长是一个年轻的女性，看上去比你大不了几岁，染了一头漂亮的粉色泡泡头，手里还捏着正在清洗的杯子"}
{"time": 1772279976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262436977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "立刻把镜子看向自己装作打扮的样子，掩盖掉惊诧的失态。然后看向她，“嗨~早上好，我还在想店开着没人在呢”"}
{"time": 1772280085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608716377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "顺带一个与人交流的友好微笑"}
{"time": 1772280109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725567681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只要开着店肯定会有人啦。\"她的语气说得上烂漫，\"不过一般这么早没有同学来呢～\"她放下手里的杯子，\"要喝什么?我推荐刚出的雪酪芝士葡萄。\""}
{"time": 1772280170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040048594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“咖啡厅首推的居然不是咖啡嘛？”带着一丝疑惑，走过去前台看看菜单"}
{"time": 1772280211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699044546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B5AB1FB9F47AB7BB681D57B78E68BD69.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR5W5hEn2ExpozFUxUY8JgvxJ7H3RiQzQog_woo69PmopL8kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ4iHujM22GvET0h611P1AD3oC-oCCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMFB15sS_RWGCDfy-aZ5viTUaK3D1eZId60j3-tz2_qWWwJxTKXv1ay58k7opaIrgJw,file_size=173712]"}
{"time": 1772280221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487429334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“有什么咖啡推荐吗？昨晚睡不好，干脆就早起了，过来提提神”"}
{"time": 1772280225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250718731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你无敌了）"}
{"time": 1772280299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571006179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔，这个里面也是有咖啡成分的啦。\"店长嘟着嘴，\"不过要是真要说的话，茉莉花香拿铁?\""}
{"time": 1772280377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006856492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“就这个呗。”从口袋拿出10块钱放在桌面上，“麻烦了”"}
{"time": 1772280487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837944997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哪个)"}
{"time": 1772280503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970315727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1571006179]（1）"}
{"time": 1772280567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465511274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(茉莉)"}
{"time": 1772280569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299276934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1772280591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827090706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（对）"}
{"time": 1772280643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368899849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好嘞。\"店长小姐点着脑袋，离开了桌前，进了里间，过一会就传来了咖啡机的声音"}
{"time": 1772280710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349863284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "看她走进里间，转身走回座位，顺带把纸团捡回来，展开看看"}
{"time": 1772280751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454651576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "上面没有变化，依然是你自己留下的字迹。"}
{"time": 1772280835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323397502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "放回口袋里，看着窗外的校园，无聊地屈指敲敲桌子，到底是缺了什么呢"}
{"time": 1772280901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258955478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过了一会，陆陆续续有学生进了校门，你的咖啡也被店长小姐端了上来，漂亮的小圆杯，飘散着茉莉的清香，上面用奶油拉了麦穗型的小花。"}
{"time": 1772280971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121139555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“谢谢~”拿起校园杯，轻轻品一口"}
{"time": 1772281006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244979809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "口感却有些奇怪，有些酸涩，或者说，称得上有些苦。"}
{"time": 1772281111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632753075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "一般吧，心里这么想着，放下本子，再巡视一圈咖啡厅"}
{"time": 1772281176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924848999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "叮叮的声音，门口的风铃响了起来"}
{"time": 1772281193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61273358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一个女生脱离走进教学楼的大部队，走进了咖啡厅。"}
{"time": 1772281199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680743367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "看过去，顺便举起咖啡再品一口"}
{"time": 1772281208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340442121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（看看是谁）"}
{"time": 1772281258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430707424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "咖啡的味道甘甜，带着茉莉的清香，很是可口，想必调这杯咖啡的人水平相当高。"}
{"time": 1772281303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293298024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（怎么byd味道变了）"}
{"time": 1772281430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944126583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯？”看向咖啡，味道似乎有点不妥？"}
{"time": 1772281569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875786551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "进来的女生留着一头长长的直发，一直垂落到腰际，值得注意得是，她有些一头引人注目的说是白色，但其实更偏向灰色的头发，眼瞳里带着些深红的血丝，校服得体很修身，一直走到你的桌边。"}
{"time": 1772281817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969254891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她低着头敲了敲桌子，\"同学?\""}
{"time": 1772282598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802667973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“怎么了”放下咖啡，看向她"}
{"time": 1772282604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230209003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（在game了）"}
{"time": 1772282625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226432621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=8D9B1690546F9F0F9C4F5DC1C1D3BEBE.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR0xokLNWhP60uuWEdtxx-Cs4epjhiPoAEg_wootN6jopv8kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQkNpVcaUN2EDXn5mX089sdnoCX_aCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMFB15sS_RWGCDfy-aZ5viTUaK3D1eZId60j3-tz2_qWWwJxTKXv1ay58k7opaIrgJw,file_size=20495]"}
{"time": 1772282635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537688822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(kimo)"}
{"time": 1772282670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844377065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的脸上挂着笑容，你从中品出几分的玩味的感觉，\"不是你在找我吗？\"她指了指自己。"}
{"time": 1772283098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013229656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯？”歪歪头，仔细端详她的容貌"}
{"time": 1772283151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047462190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "这么特殊的容貌，在学校应该很容易留下印象，回想一下以前我见过她吗"}
{"time": 1772283176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527946484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "灵感"}
{"time": 1772283362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216856001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": ".ra灵感"}
{"time": 1772283362, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1216856001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[星野鶇]进行技能[灵感:60]检定: 1D100=33/60 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1772283419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455762879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "似乎没有见过"}
{"time": 1772285194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783820600", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "点点头，打开桌面上的笔记本，撕下一小块揉皱扔给她"}
{"time": 1772285206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711151722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "然后点点头，打开桌面上的笔记本，撕下一小块揉皱扔给她"}
{"time": 1772285413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342533849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她接过你递出来的纸条捏在手里，脸上挂着盈盈笑意，\"哦呀?这是想做什么?\""}
{"time": 1772285554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719191873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯？没什么”把笔记本合上放回书包里面，“坐呗，在学校这么久，怎么我一点见过你的印象都没有”"}
{"time": 1772286528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658219735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"很正常呢。\"她依然挂着得体的笑容，自从见了面之后就没有摘下来，\"毕竟我不喜欢社交。\""}
{"time": 1772286577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753403404", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“”"}
{"time": 1772286630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743147363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，我的意思是，你的特征，很引人注意呀”仔细听听她的声音，是不是昨天在讲台听到的一样"}
{"time": 1772286839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90400367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，这对于我来说，也是一个很麻烦的地方嘛。\"她的笑声清脆，\"在怀疑我?\"挑了挑眉"}
{"time": 1772287507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668728237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“倒没有，只是好奇”陪她笑笑"}
{"time": 1772287513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132687893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“要喝点什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1772288471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248470431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“茉莉拿铁?\"她伸出手在你的杯子上扇了扇，鼻尖微微翕动，“我也要一杯吧，唔...不介意的话。”"}
{"time": 1772288607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881268487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“很懂嘛”侧过头看向前台，招招手大声把声音送过去，“老板，加杯茉莉拿铁”"}
{"time": 1772288692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263116794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "随即收回目光，“不介意不介意，突然来和我聊聊天什么的，也是惊喜了。”抿口咖啡，眼神不自觉躲闪"}
{"time": 1772289044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946697680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“要说的话。”她眯着眼睛盯着你，“不是鸫先找的我吗？”"}
{"time": 1772290428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217868796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（人呢）"}
{"time": 1772292300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527848091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（消失了）"}
{"time": 1772292303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787242327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（伊小诺）"}
{"time": 1772292328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082105182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=8D9B1690546F9F0F9C4F5DC1C1D3BEBE.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR0xokLNWhP60uuWEdtxx-Cs4epjhiPoAEg_wooupr1tL_8kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQTNBAMH20wDniJKO4gEKjtXoCZhKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMMW-tIRFWoGSCLo73nbRaK835eihBYdwh1BR-3ChprWDQm7Qc5PyBJ5Pr23aRMnYzg,file_size=20495]"}
{"time": 1772292428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1316325653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嘛，不是先捡到你的纸条嘛。你当时是怎么扔过来的”看着她的容貌，会不会是班里或者其他人化过妆，又或者是那位刚来的留学生"}
{"time": 1772292685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583875923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我会魔法哦?\"她指着自己，表情有些捉摸不透，\"像，凭空写字这种事情...\"她拖着长音看向你"}
{"time": 1772293046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250654567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“校园九大不可思议呀，好厉害”手从杯子松开，鼓鼓掌。“不过你为什么找上我呢”"}
{"time": 1772293495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968608334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大概，就和我昨天说过的原因一样?\"她低头做思考状，\"不想很孤单。\""}
{"time": 1772293868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791751680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这样呀....”叹口气，轻轻点点头，“你也和我一样因为特别的外貌才受到霸凌的吗”脱下眼罩，解开绷带，露出里面的金色义眼"}
{"time": 1772294243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173131616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"她饶有兴趣地打量着你的眼睛，\"那，我的外貌怎么样?\"她一只手撑着脸笑着"}
{"time": 1772294270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979415029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=0F02037C2AB0F84D36B20ED122087E0A.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR46qfBVWXFOGn_S2GZAPxdw4vjkRj3_BAg_woonbna0sb8kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQnhV_BZw4sw20b902XjchWHoC0DaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMOTWwvmm0sw5q_LM-NqDmDwMM7FYXMfBmfTYExQYmRRm9qpiwpFManeGX1702MoD2g,file_size=278135]"}
{"time": 1772294273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167958697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大概这样吧，也行)"}
{"time": 1772294275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269013557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也许)"}
{"time": 1772294375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702088281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（不是，设定中不都是黑发吗）"}
{"time": 1772294389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123196346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯...像雪？”"}
{"time": 1772294418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717976443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "想到昨天的事情，看着她的眼睛"}
{"time": 1772294437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53530320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不过眼睛倒，像血一样呢”"}
{"time": 1772294534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160775289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（这角色谁，白眼一个红点，好像月代雪）"}
{"time": 1772294703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261557515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(笑)"}
{"time": 1772294827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244501498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（别笑，你来也过不了第二关）"}
{"time": 1772295004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305337814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1702088281](我说了这个是灰发啊)"}
{"time": 1772295010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302753015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=875786551]()"}
{"time": 1772295020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844080611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（不是白发吗）"}
{"time": 1772295026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034642103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(差不多吧)"}
{"time": 1772295028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558177479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我超）"}
{"time": 1772295041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878981923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我第一眼是 白发红瞳）"}
{"time": 1772295043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135577095", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（不知道吧）"}
{"time": 1772295050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224293450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你知道吧）"}
{"time": 1772295058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195841006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那不是妥妥被80的模版）"}
{"time": 1772295081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208202543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛...很多人都这么说我，但是我毕竟...\"她轻轻笑着，\"嗯，不重要。\""}
{"time": 1772295090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582483459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(笑)"}
{"time": 1772295147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227591944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“确实，也没啥所谓”重新缠上绷带，带好眼罩"}
{"time": 1772295199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900038244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不过我确实也是，有点孤单吧”叹口气，笑笑"}
{"time": 1772295242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85017542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟，只有我会和你说话了。\"她的双手叠在一起，撑在桌上。"}
{"time": 1772295270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838362923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你是不是在找 お友達なの）"}
{"time": 1772295379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493097994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“那太感谢你了。”身体放松靠在椅子上，抬头看看天舒缓下脖子。“话说回来，你知道我孤单的原因吧”重新坐直，捧起咖啡喝一口"}
{"time": 1772295381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869005934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实是长崎素世)"}
{"time": 1772295397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20793059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（就是soyo这个动作说的嘛）"}
{"time": 1772295402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830372364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"她摆出洗耳倾听的架势"}
{"time": 1772295404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448364760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(✓)"}
{"time": 1772295455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577954399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“咦？我还以为你知道呢？毕竟会这种超距离刻写的魔术哦”"}
{"time": 1772295584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023398520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"知道归知道，不过倾听，是好习惯吧?\"她的脑袋微微歪了些"}
{"time": 1772295645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076782377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也是吧。你知道到什么程度呢，也方便我和你说不是嘛”"}
{"time": 1772295753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604382926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所有的一切。\"她微笑着，\"你的一切，你遭遇的一切，我都看在眼里哦?\""}
{"time": 1772295838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512907036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（无语，典型的伊拉诺谜语）"}
{"time": 1772295852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786107571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "。st show"}
