{"time": 1772295903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453768038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“真的嘛？”眨眨眼，“感觉你在骗我”"}
{"time": 1772295954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335955540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（明早你起得来吗）"}
{"time": 1772295990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969504110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1512907036](干嘛啊)"}
{"time": 1772296002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433761662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有一些这样的话，不就太无趣了吗)"}
{"time": 1772296010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258491052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=003DE103D207C2DAB0BC67D661D88887.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSUBeqoZ_93dvNUie-sWNb0h2_K2BjWq1kg_wooht3pkM38kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ12klEMqNbWVXFuPSMUsoLHoCCZmCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMOTWwvmm0sw5q_LM-NqDmDwMM7FYXMfBmfTYExQYmRRm9qpiwpFManeGX1702MoD2g,file_size=1463766]"}
{"time": 1772296038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962880593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（彳亍）"}
{"time": 1772296079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594155634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1453768038]\"好啦，毕竟是应约邀请。\"她放下手，\"干嘛弄得这么沉重，我不在乎他们说的那些事情，死了，也算是一种安慰，不是吗？\""}
{"time": 1772296107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268290295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"况且，恶灵啊，这种说法就和咒怨一样。\"她低头沉思，\"你看过伽椰子的事吗？\""}
{"time": 1772296138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196020674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也没有啦，都习惯了。都生活这么久了”"}
{"time": 1772296148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154109711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“电影嘛，看过”"}
