{"time": 1772340673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400837620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“铃木和佐伯是？”"}
{"time": 1772340773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407738099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"她稍微歪了歪脑袋，\"鸫说是看过了，结果只是听过的程度嘛。\"她伸出一根手指，\"铃木是想要解决咒怨的人。\"紧接着伸出第二根手指，\"佐伯是，杀死伽椰子的人。\""}
{"time": 1772340853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078562971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "正巧在这个时候，店长把咖啡放到你的面前，\"第二杯咖啡，请慢用。\""}
{"time": 1772340908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145879300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“谢谢”看向店长，笑笑，然后把咖啡推到这位灰发少女面前"}
{"time": 1772340916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845609527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“对了，我还没知道你的名字呢”"}
