{"time": 1772341079, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1576117215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[星野鶇]进行技能[侦查:60]检定: 1D100=42/60 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1772341190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983102134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "店长似乎对你投来了一些怀疑和好奇的视线，但没有多问就离开了，你看到她比起早间多穿了一件罩衫。"}
{"time": 1772341245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493361886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1845609527]\"不是已经问过了吗？\"她对你递出手，\"还在你这里吧。\""}
{"time": 1772341366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629792560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“yuki？”"}
{"time": 1772341531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560099113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"ゆき。\""}
{"time": 1772341721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805287183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "看到店长的神情，意识到这些事情还是找没人的地方慢慢聊聊的比较好，于是拿出手机，打开联系人页面。\"好的yuki酱，时间也不早了，加个联系方式吧，晚些我们再聊聊\""}
{"time": 1772341906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586153362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她笑了笑，给你报了一串号码，\"不再聊聊吗？\""}
{"time": 1772342648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430278072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"反正，现在过去也很难赶上上课了吧?\""}
{"time": 1772342734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124422555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也是呢，边走边聊吧”把号码填进去，拿两杯咖啡去前台，“店长～打包，麻烦了”"}
{"time": 1772342849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771325055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦。\"店长点了点头，挂着热情的笑容\"在这边坐这么久，算你八折好了。\"她一边打包，一边开口，\"我就知道会打包的，早就做好准备了。\""}
{"time": 1772342944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726889685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说完她把两杯封好的咖啡递给了你，\"不过也没想到会坐这么久呢，第一节课已经在上了。\""}
{"time": 1772343112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961207955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嘛，谢谢店长，下次再来”笑笑对店长表示感谢，小跑回来把袋子递给yuki，来，你的咖啡"}
{"time": 1772343235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160265847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她摆了摆手，事实上刚刚她就没有喝过这杯咖啡，\"鸫先拿着吧，我们去哪里逛逛?\""}
