{"time": 1772361915, "type": "reply", "message_id": "752071027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[星野鶇]进行技能[聆听:60]检定: 1D100=45/60 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1772361954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537280081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“还要保持这样吗”班长小声开口"}
{"time": 1772361958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104930678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1641402503]转校生也参与到这个规则也挺有趣的，她不敢看我我倒想看着她"}
{"time": 1772361963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805721222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“继续遵守吗”"}
{"time": 1772361972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996150947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "雨纪小声回答，\"嗯。\""}
{"time": 1772361988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232853664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "摊摊手，“发生什么事了吗”，当然也没想过她们会回答我"}
{"time": 1772362126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270904863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你注意到雨纪和绫似乎是被你吓到了，两个人都抖了抖"}
{"time": 1772362151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900868162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“一会帮我请个假。”雨纪开口，离开了这里，绫紧紧跟在她后面。"}
{"time": 1772362179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039070818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "班长则是神色复杂地看了你一眼，不动声色地指了指办公室，跟上了前面两个"}
{"time": 1772362218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868630234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嘛，不还是一样嘛”"}
{"time": 1772362222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384945647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "说完我上天台了"}
{"time": 1772362466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474745822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "顺便路上回两次头，看看有没有人跟着我"}
{"time": 1772362486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62183106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有"}
{"time": 1772362498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107423275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不过先sv了)"}
{"time": 1772362519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533206162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（okok）"}
{"time": 1772436877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "355659798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "今天的天气说不上多好，但也不算糟糕。你顺顺利利地走上天台，和昨天来的时候一样，这地方从来就不会有什么变化，但今天前面站着一个白发的女孩。"}
{"time": 1772438816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523244848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“久等了”"}
{"time": 1772438897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019578374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“老师没来，感觉班里像出了什么事情。”害怕在下面浪费了太多时间，匆匆跑上天台。"}
{"time": 1772438974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380892906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不去确认一下吗？\"你看见她把两杯咖啡放在边沿上，自己也坐在了上面。不过后面那风化年久的铁栏杆，总有些摇摇欲坠的意思。"}
{"time": 1772439046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397263777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这里可年久失修了，小心点哦”说是这么说，依旧像往常那样走到旁边靠在栏杆旁，压出“吱吱”的声响"}
{"time": 1772439104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537361710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“确认也....与我无关。嘛，我也不属于这个班级了，出什么事也不会和我说，晚点再想办法收集下情报吧。”"}
{"time": 1772439124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882563446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“如果你能帮帮忙就再好不过了”"}
{"time": 1772439349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069062270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯?\"她看向你，\"明明说着和自己无关，却还要插手吗？\"语气倒是听不出什么情绪"}
{"time": 1772439567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966472794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“为什么呢？真是矛盾呀”侧过身，把手放在眼睛与太阳之间。“我倒也希望能一直与我无关，这样大家能顺利毕业也好”"}
{"time": 1772439604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363024749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不过，如果他们真出事了，是不是也是他们活该呢”垂下手，低头苦笑"}
{"time": 1772439786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369642488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"或许，已经出事了哦?小鸫。\"对面的女生把手搭在你的肩膀上，拂了拂你的发丝。"}
{"time": 1772439851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441726734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "紧接着，她身后的铁栏杆不堪重负，应声而断，整个人毫无征兆地坠落了下去。"}
{"time": 1772439898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375326014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“诶？？？？！！！”立刻伸手尝试抓住她"}
{"time": 1772439919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312921868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“yuki酱？”"}
{"time": 1772439945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006723142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（byd搞我是吧）"}
{"time": 1772439975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226982040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你敏捷)"}
{"time": 1772440004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367306426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "。ra敏捷"}
{"time": 1772440004, "type": "reply", "message_id": "367306426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[星野鶇]进行技能[敏捷:60]检定: 1D100=69/60 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1772440015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997648155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那你死吧（无慈悲）"}
{"time": 1772440138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243515502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的手未能握住她，她的嘴巴似乎动了动说了什么，但你没能听清。你只看见她的嘴角挂着笑容，平和，又带着些已经做完了什么事的满足。"}
{"time": 1772440158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208306432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "然后"}
{"time": 1772440185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045402402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "然后"}
{"time": 1772440211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877679171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "泪流两行，嘴角抽搐，为她送行。只是一个刚认识的朋友，理解不了她在做什么。"}
{"time": 1772440263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003163690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她落到了地上，重物落地的声音传到你的耳边，砰的一声，在你眼中，女孩的身躯炸开来。满目猩红"}
{"time": 1772440272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870177137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "sc1d3/1d6"}
{"time": 1772440299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581148494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "昨晚妹妹的梦，在说班级出问题了，还是说这个人有问题。这个人是害我？假装是朋友？这样有什么意义吗？她也不是这个班级的，还是说和班级有联系？各种念头萦绕不去。"}
{"time": 1772440306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505403189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "。sc1d3/1d6"}
{"time": 1772440306, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1505403189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[星野鶇]进行理智检定[80]:\n1D100=34/80 困难成功，且将新火试新茶，诗酒趁年华\n理智减少1d3=2点,当前剩余[78]点"}
{"time": 1772440359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262751727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“啊....啊.....\"高强度冲击让大脑放弃了思考，跪在地上失声痛哭起来。"}
{"time": 1772440716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781501331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "少顷，从包里拿毛巾出来擦擦眼泪，下楼"}
{"time": 1772440958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103571285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "警笛声从远而近"}
{"time": 1772440981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705616252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看到几辆警车停在了校门"}
{"time": 1772441315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122619730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "靠近尸体呈现的细节更是触目惊心，还记得今早一起聊天喝着咖啡，突然就剩下一大块的血与肉。不知道自己能做什么，也不知道自己应该做什么，也不再想做任何事。难得倘开心扉就受到慢慢的恶意。如同自己不属于这个世界一般，大脑主动放弃了思考，四周似乎十分吵闹，红蓝的车顶灯循环闪烁，我不过静静站在尸体面前，蹲下，手指轻轻沾了点鲜血，是红色的，不是雪，仅此而已。剩下的我就不知道了。"}
{"time": 1772441538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059210766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大家都没有看着你，警察们朝着教学楼里跑去，有意地避开了你"}
{"time": 1772441578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126567888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "或者说，他们不敢看着你，不敢看向你这里。"}
{"time": 1772441737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811946656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "972136174", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（快进到有人叫我吧）"}
